{"slug": "best-lead-sources-for-contractors", "title": "The Best Lead Sources for Contractors (and Which to Avoid) | ScaleLocal", "description": "A ranked, honest breakdown of where contractor leads actually come from in 2026 — from owned Google leads to shared lead-gen platforms — and which are worth your money.", "card_blurb": "A ranked, honest breakdown of where leads actually come from — and which are worth your money.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>The Best Lead Sources for Contractors (and Which to Avoid) | ScaleLocal</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"A ranked, honest breakdown of where contractor leads actually come from in 2026 — from owned Google leads to shared lead-gen platforms — and which are worth your money.\">\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.scalelocal.net/blog/best-lead-sources-for-contractors/\">\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.svg\">\n  <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/favicon-32.png\">\n  <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\">\n  <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"ScaleLocal\">\n  <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Best Lead Sources for Contractors in 2026 (and Which to Avoid)\">\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A ranked, honest breakdown of where contractor leads actually come from in 2026 — from owned Google leads to shared lead-gen platforms — and which are worth your money.\">\n  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.scalelocal.net/og-image.png\">\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.scalelocal.net/blog/best-lead-sources-for-contractors/\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n  <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.scalelocal.net/og-image.png\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" hr